== bufferline, 2 buffers, on x
@kak_bufferline " x.txt  y.txt "
ok   status line on
== after edit z.txt
@kak_bufferline " x.txt  y.txt  z.txt "
== z modified
ok   z modified
== split: client1 in the new pane; switch client0 between buffers and back
@kak_bufferline " x.txt  y.txt  z.txt[+] "
pane0 (should be z active):
@kak_bufferline "#[in] x.txt #[in] y.txt #[ACTIVE] z.txt[+] #[default]"
'sent:' '%1|y.txt|fg=#2c323c,bg=#61afef,underscore,us=#2c323c|fg=#5c6370,bg=#2c323c|false:x.txt false:y.txt true:z.txt' '%0|z.txt|fg=#2c323c,bg=#61afef,underscore,us=#2c323c|fg=#5c6370,bg=#2c323c|false:x.txt false:y.txt true:z.txt'
== status line dimming
'c1' 'dimmed' 'true' 'unfocused:' 'client1'
'c0' 'dimmed' 'false'
ok   terminal focus out: c0 dimmed
ok   focus in: c0 not dimmed
